@startuml ledger-domain-relations
title ledger.domain — model relations

' Names and relations only. Column-level properties are a later task.
' Contexts do not share tables.

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
hide empty members

package ledger {
  package domain {
    enum AccountType {
      ASSET
      LIABILITY
      INCOME
    }

    class Account
    class JournalEntry
    class JournalLine

    Account "*" --> "1" AccountType : type
    JournalEntry "1" *-- "2..*" JournalLine : lines
    JournalLine "*" --> "1" Account : account
  }
}

note bottom of JournalEntry
  One balanced posting. The lines commit together.
  Valid only when debits equal credits.
  LedgerService rejects anything else.
  Nothing outside LedgerService inserts a JournalLine.
end note

note right of Account
  Seeded chart
  --
  1000 Cash — ASSET
  2100 Customer Deposits — Ada Lovelace — LIABILITY
  2200 Merchant Deposits — Café Orquídea — LIABILITY
  2300 Settlement Suspense — LIABILITY
  4100 Interchange Income — INCOME
end note

note bottom of JournalLine
  One side of an entry: a debit or a credit,
  tied to one Account.
  A posted balance is the sum of posted lines.
  JournalLine is not its own aggregate;
  audit names the JournalEntry.
end note

@enduml
